      "title_at_revision": "Bearing factors.",
      "text": "(a) Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, each part that has clearance (free fit), and that is subject to pounding or vibration, must have a bearing factor large enough to provide for the effects of normal relative motion.\n(b) No bearing factor need be used for a part for which any larger special factor is prescribed.",
